{"id":"6d8fcb9f00b24440","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-model5-union-chain.md","title":"ZFC Model5 Union Chain","display":"df-zfc-model5-union-chain — ZFC Model5 Union Chain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model5-union-chain","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model5-union-chain"],"display":"df-zfc-model5-union-chain — ZFC Model5 Union Chain","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model5-union-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model5-union-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model5-union-chain — ZFC Model5 Union Chain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LinearOrder}(I,\\leq_I)\">\\(\\operatorname{LinearOrder}(I,\\leq_I)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(I\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,T,\\vec M,M\\in V\">\\(L,T,\\vec M,M\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> are the set-coded predicates from the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{A,B}=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(A)\\}\">\\(\\iota_{A,B}=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(A)\\}\\)</span> denotes the inclusion map when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(B)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5UnionChain}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5UnionChain}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}union\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel5UnionChain}_S(I,\\leq_I,L,T,\\vec M,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{LinearOrder}(I,\\leq_I)\n\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\vec M(i),L)\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\vec M(i),T))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(i\\leq_I j\\to\n\\exists\\iota_{ij}\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\iota_{ij}=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\vec M(i))\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(\\iota_{ij},\\vec M(i),\\vec M(j))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\operatorname{Univ}(M)=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Univ}(\\vec M(i))\n\\land\\mathrm{Model}(M,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\exists\\iota_i\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\iota_i=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\vec M(i))\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(\\iota_i,\\vec M(i),M)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}union\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel5UnionChain}_S(I,\\leq_I,L,T,\\vec M,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{LinearOrder}(I,\\leq_I)\n\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\vec M(i),L)\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\vec M(i),T))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(i\\leq_I j\\to\n\\exists\\iota_{ij}\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\iota_{ij}=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\vec M(i))\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(\\iota_{ij},\\vec M(i),\\vec M(j))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\operatorname{Univ}(M)=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Univ}(\\vec M(i))\n\\land\\mathrm{Model}(M,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\exists\\iota_i\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\iota_i=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\vec M(i))\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(\\iota_i,\\vec M(i),M)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The chain is a set-coded function rather than an element of the nonexistent set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^I\">\\(V^I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Elementary inclusion maps bind the former informal symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq_L\">\\(\\preccurlyeq_L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Interp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Interp}\\)</span>; because the carriers exhaust <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>, they force the union structure to agree with every stage on all symbols.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LinearOrder}(I,\\leq_I)$ and $I\\ne\\varnothing$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{LinearOrder}(I,\\leq_I)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"L,T,\\vec M,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_{A,B}=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5UnionChain}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}union\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel5UnionChain}_S(I,\\leq_I,L,T,\\vec M,M)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{LinearOrder}(I,\\leq_I)\n\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\vec M(i),L)\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\vec M(i),T))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\Bigl(i\\leq_I j\\to\n\\exists\\iota_{ij}\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\iota_{ij}=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\vec M(i))\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(\\iota_{ij},\\vec M(i),\\vec M(j))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\operatorname{Univ}(M)=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\mathrm{Univ}(\\vec M(i))\n\\land\\mathrm{Model}(M,T)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\exists\\iota_i\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\iota_i=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\vec M(i))\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(\\iota_i,\\vec M(i),M)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V^I","display":false},{"tex":"\\preccurlyeq_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Interp}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":2291,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2756","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-model5-union-chain.md|58-df-zfc-model5-union-chain]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["2aa29158e60b337f","36d7463d215be751","d9b8711cda3f31ca","8b6a90316aad78a4","a25c0a66cf56c0f4","65418b505fc53093"]}